{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=780 height=44 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/e44b5b115184e22ab023efa77f60f741.avif?t=1755280048\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamdew Adventures is a Cozy Exploration RPG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the warm embrace of Eldoria, a cozy RPG where heartfelt adventures await. Journey through a world brimming with charm, where you\u2019ll forge friendships, share stories, and restore the land\u2019s gentle magic. Perfect for unwinding with a mug of tea and a blanket, this game is your haven of relaxation and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/faaac9220e936a9241f2248c29501023.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/faaac9220e936a9241f2248c29501023.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/faaac9220e936a9241f2248c29501023.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful Pixel Graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Eldoria\u2019s vibrant pixel art, where every meadow, village, and Starshard sparkles with life. From the fields of Evervale to the misty hues of Veilmarsh, the hand-crafted visuals burst with color and charm, creating a cozy world that feels like a living storybook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/eac8f52558454287dbf6cb9864de4723.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/eac8f52558454287dbf6cb9864de4723.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/eac8f52558454287dbf6cb9864de4723.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Vast World of Eldoria</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander across Eldoria\u2019s breathtaking landscapes, from sunlit valleys to misty marshes. Uncover hidden secrets, discover glowing Starshards, and let curiosity guide you through a world filled with cozy nooks, ancient ruins, and enchanting surprises waiting around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/54e440eb38dd07120e0914c5ca49cb59.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/54e440eb38dd07120e0914c5ca49cb59.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/54e440eb38dd07120e0914c5ca49cb59.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovely NPCs with Their Own Daily Lives and Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Eldoria\u2019s delightful inhabitants, from quirky bakers to dreamy stargazers, each with their own routines and heartfelt tales. Build friendships, help with daily tasks, and uncover their unique stories as you weave a tapestry of community that makes Eldoria feel like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/733929ccad89cd43a1ec9842dcd1cf93.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/733929ccad89cd43a1ec9842dcd1cf93.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/733929ccad89cd43a1ec9842dcd1cf93.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Get Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a curious adventurer to a skilled Starweaver as you collect Starshards and hone your abilities. Level up through heartfelt quests, and defeating enemies. Each step forward makes you stronger, ready to weave the land\u2019s magic back to its full glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/8b4065102f5e0ccd71bc05b9a17bcf4d.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/8b4065102f5e0ccd71bc05b9a17bcf4d.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/8b4065102f5e0ccd71bc05b9a17bcf4d.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a Legendary Starweaver</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace your destiny as a descendant of the Starweavers, guardians of Eldoria\u2019s light. Through courage and kindness, you\u2019ll gather Starshards to restore the Everstar, earning your place in legend. Craft a legacy of hope and harmony in this heartwarming tale of heroism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.poster.avif?t=1755280048\" width=780 height=44 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.webm?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.mp4?t=1755280048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943570?t=1755280048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/ba5f1a71e4ef93ba8faaaee4afa2b193bc88575c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755280048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/0c427a9f8f7e80e79f086a780b3b41ec4cf64684/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755280048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943570/0c427a9f8f7e80e79f086a780b3b41ec4cf646